<title>MALAYSIA: Innovest says gets 300 mln rgt project.</title>
<headline>Innovest says gets 300 mln rgt project.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian timber and property group Innovest Bhd said on Tuesday it has been awarded a hotel and commercial complex project in Madagaskar valued at about 300 million ringgit</p>
</text>
